n class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span>（略大于 7）。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步（指示剂）</strong>：酸碱滴定指示剂要落在<strong>滴定突跃范围</strong>内——酚酞变色范围（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8.2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8.2\\sim10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span>）与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pH&gt;7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span> 的终点匹配 ⇒ 选<strong>酚酞</strong>。</p>\n<p>选 <strong>B</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：弱酸强碱（或强酸弱碱）滴定 → <strong>两句口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;谁强显谁性&quot;</strong>：弱酸滴强碱（产物强碱弱酸盐）→ 终点 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pH&gt;7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span> → 用酚酞；\n强酸滴弱碱（产物弱碱强酸盐）→ 终点 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pH&lt;7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span> → 用甲基橙。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>15 秒：B</strong>——先定产物的&quot;谁强显谁性&quot;，指示剂自然出炉。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"用 0.1 mol/L 0.1\\,\\text{mol/L} 0.1 mol/L 的 N a O H NaOH N a O H 溶液滴定 20 mL 20\\,\\text{mL} 20 mL 0.1 mol/L 0.1\\,\\text{mol/L","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"中档","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"“恰好完全反应”≠“溶液 pH=7”——弱酸强碱盐生成时 pH>7；强酸弱碱盐时 pH<7；指示剂选在滴定突跃范围内。","fit":["用 NaOH 滴定 CH₃COOH","判断终点 pH/指示剂选择","选填题"],"updated":"Tue Feb 18 20